  "bodySnippet": "SMTP2GO Email delivery done right.\nPricingProduct TourCustomersFAQLog In Sign Up\n×\nStart your free account\n$79 / month\n$948 / year\nStart your free account\nWork email\nStart your free account\nFull Name\nCompany\nCreate a Password\nEnter SMS Verification Code\nPlease enter the 5 digit code sent to your phone\nDidn't get a code? Resend\nCode resent\n\nAlready registered? Log in\n\nJoin over 40,000 people and businesses using SMTP2GO.\n\nGet started with our free plan for up to 1,000 emails per month.\n\nSign Up Free\nNo credit card required\nHow many emails do you send per month?\n1K\nFree Plan\n\n0\n1\n5\n3\n0\n$\n0/mo\n\nFor testing & sending low volumes. Limited to 200 emails/day.\n\n1,000 emails/mo\n5 days of email reporting\nTicket support only\nExtra emails not permitted\nStarter\n\n7\n5\n1\n7\n0\n2\n8\n0\n5\n2\n0\n$\n15/mo\n\nAll of the essential features to take charge of your email delivery.\n\n10,000 emails/mo\n30 days of email reporting\nTicket/chat/phone support\nSubaccount management\nSMS messaging\nScheduled reporting\nExtra emails: $1.20 / thousand\nProfessional\n\n$\n75/mo\n\nFull email sending control with enhanced reporting & features.\n\n100,000 emails/mo\n30 days of email reporting\nTicket/chat/phone support\nSubaccount management\nSMS messaging\nScheduled reporting\nDedicated IP address\nEmail testing tools\nExtra emails: $0.85 / thousand\nMonthly\nAnnually\nAll prices in USD\n\nOur Promise: If you don’t love us within 30 days, we’ll give you a full refund.\n\nFree\n\n$\n0/mo\n\nStarter\n\n$\n15/mo\n\nProfessional\n\n$\n75/mo\n\nSending Features\nFree\nSt"
}
